ry\u202f2021 Formosa\u202fPlastics disruption. The only material retrieved consists of standard supply\u2011chain risk disclosures that are not event\u2011specific, and an unrelated Dow filing that does not discuss the incident.\n\n**Remaining gaps**\n\n* A proper downstream traversal from the disrupted firm (Formosa\u202fPlastics) to enumerate at\u2011risk customers or alternative suppliers.\n* Targeted filings from those identified companies confirming exposure to the Formosa\u202fPlastics outage.\n* Additional corpus searches using refined queries (e.g., \u201cFormosa Plastics plant fire 2021\u201d, \u201cFormosa Plastics shutdown impact\u201d) that might surface event\u2011specific mentions.\n\nUntil those steps can be performed, the scope and severity of the February\u202f2021 supply\u2011chain disruption remain **unconfirmed**.\n\nCOVERAGE GAPS (43) -- reported explicitly, not omitted:\n  - formosa petrochemical: no evidence gathered\n  - nexen tire: no evidence gathered\n  - formosa chemicals & fibre: no evidence gathered\n  - taita chemical: no evidence gathered\n  - nan ya plastics: no evidence gathered\n  - saudi basic industries: no evidence gathered\n  - saudi arabian oil: no evidence gathered\n  - shun on electronic: no evidence gathered\n  - axalta coating systems: no evidence gathered\n  - corteva: no evidence gathered\n  - volkswagen: no evidence gathered\n  - cayman engley industrial: no evidence gathered\n  - zeon: no evidence gathered\n  - cpc corp/taiwan: no evidence gathered\n  - grupo pochteca sab de cv: no evidence gathered\n  - lanxess: no evidence gathered\n  - asahi kasei: no evidence gathered\n  - samsung electronics: no evidence gathered\n  - sk: no evidence gathered\n  - indian oil: no evidence gathered\n  - toyota motor: no evidence gathered\n  - dl holdings co lirl: no evidence gathered\n  - nexen: no evidence gathered\n  - basf se: no evidence gathered\n  - jsr: no evidence gathered\n  - jordan petroleum refinery: no evidence gathered